    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have 30 seconds to find the object that matches the image shown at the top, among a pile of chaotic items. If you successfully find it, you will pass the level and gain an additional 4 seconds of searching time to help you in the following levels. However, each time you select the wrong item, precious searching time will be deducted. When time runs out, the game ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy high-level challenges, you can choose the &quot;Crazy Mode.&quot; With each passing level, the number of items below will increase significantly, making the difficulty rise sharply. In contrast, in &quot;Casual Mode,&quot; the number of items remains fixed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game occupies little space, and you can play it with a simple click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing background music, the game offers a relaxing experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have 30 seconds to find the object that matches the image shown at the top, among a pile of chaotic items. If you successfully find it, you will pass the level and gain an additional 4 seconds of searching time to help you in the following levels. However, each time you select the wrong item, precious searching time will be deducted. When time runs out, the game ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy high-level challenges, you can choose the &quot;Crazy Mode.&quot; With each passing level, the number of items below will increase significantly, making the difficulty rise sharply. In contrast, in &quot;Casual Mode,&quot; the number of items remains fixed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game occupies little space, and you can play it with a simple click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing background music, the game offers a relaxing experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u201cThe Hidden Mystery\u201d is an interesting find-the-object game that can train your eyesight and reaction speed.&quot;",
